NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add-ons add files, dependencies, and code hooks to generated projects."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use this guide when you want to build and maintain your own add-on outside the built-in catalog."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"quick-start","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Quick Start"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# 1. Create base project\ntanstack create my-addon-dev -y\n\n# 2. Add your code\n#    - src/integrations/my-feature/\n#    - src/routes/demo/my-feature.tsx\n#    - Update package.json\n\n# 3. Extract add-on\ntanstack add-on init\n\n# 4. Edit .add-on/info.json\n\n# 5. Compile\ntanstack add-on compile\n\n# Optional: continuously rebuild while authoring\ntanstack add-on dev\n\n# 6. Test locally\nnpx serve .add-on -l 9080\ntanstack create test --add-ons http://localhost:9080/info.json","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"structure","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Structure"}]},{"type":"code","value":".add-on/\n├── info.json        # Metadata (required)\n├── package.json     # Dependencies (optional)\n└── assets/          # Files to copy\n    └── src/\n        ├── integrations/my-feature/\n        └── routes/demo/my-feature.tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Generated source of truth files in your project root:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":".add-on/info.json"},{"type":"text","value":" - add-on metadata and integration config"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":".add-on/package.json"},{"type":"text","value":" - dependency/script additions merged into generated apps"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":".add-on/assets/**"},{"type":"text","value":" - template files copied into target apps"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"info-json","children":[{"type":"text","value":"info.json"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required fields:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"name\": \"My Feature\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.1\",\n  \"description\": \"What it does\",\n  \"type\": \"add-on\",\n  \"phase\": \"add-on\",\n  \"category\": \"tooling\",\n  \"modes\": [\"file-router\"]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Field"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Values"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"version"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Semantic version for your add-on metadata (e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"0.0.1"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"type"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"add-on"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toolchain"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"deployment"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"example"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"phase"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"setup"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"add-on"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"example"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"category"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"auth"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"database"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"orm"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"deploy"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tooling"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"monitoring"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"api"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"i18n"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cms"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"other"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional fields:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"dependsOn\": [\"tanstack-query\"],\n  \"conflicts\": [\"other-feature\"],\n  \"envVars\": [{ \"name\": \"API_KEY\", \"description\": \"...\", \"required\": true }],\n  \"gitignorePatterns\": [\"*.cache\"]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"hooks-integrations","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Hooks (Integrations)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Inject code into generated projects:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"integrations\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"root-provider\",\n      \"jsName\": \"MyProvider\",\n      \"path\": \"src/integrations/my-feature/provider.tsx\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Location"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"root-provider"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Wraps app in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"__root.tsx"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Context providers"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"provider"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Same, but simpler"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic providers"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vite-plugin"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vite.config.ts"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vite plugins"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"devtools"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"After app in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"__root.tsx"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Devtools"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"header-user"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Header component"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"User menu, auth UI"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"layout"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Layout wrapper"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dashboard layouts"}]}]]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"demo-routes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Demo Routes"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"routes\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"/demo/my-feature\",\n      \"name\": \"My Feature Demo\",\n      \"path\": \"src/routes/demo/my-feature.tsx\",\n      \"jsName\": \"MyFeatureDemo\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"add-on-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add-on Options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Let users configure the add-on:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"options\": {\n    \"database\": {\n      \"type\": \"select\",\n      \"label\": \"Database\",\n      \"options\": [\n        { \"value\": \"postgres\", \"label\": \"PostgreSQL\" },\n        { \"value\": \"sqlite\", \"label\": \"SQLite\" }\n      ],\n      \"default\": \"postgres\"\n    }\n  }\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Access in EJS templates:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<% if (addOnOption['my-feature']?.database === 'postgres') { %>\n// PostgreSQL code\n<% } %>","lang":"ejs"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"ejs-templates","children":[{"type":"text","value":"EJS Templates"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Files ending in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".ejs"},{"type":"text","value":" are processed. Available variables:"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Variable"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"projectName"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"string"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Project name"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"typescript"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TS enabled"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tailwind"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tailwind enabled"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"addOnEnabled"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"object"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ [id]: boolean }"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"addOnOption"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"object"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ [id]: options }"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"File patterns:"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pattern"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Result"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"file.ts"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Copied as-is"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"file.ts.ejs"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"EJS processed"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"_dot_gitignore"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Becomes "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".gitignore"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"file.ts.append"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Appended to existing"}]}]]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"distribution","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Distribution"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Host on GitHub, npm, or any URL:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack create my-app --add-ons https://example.com/my-addon/info.json","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"local-iteration-loop","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Local Iteration Loop"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Fastest way to iterate on a custom add-on:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# in your add-on project\ntanstack add-on compile\nnpx serve .add-on -l 9080\n\n# in another terminal\ntanstack create test-app --add-ons http://localhost:9080/info.json","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you are actively editing templates, run "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack add-on dev"},{"type":"text","value":" to auto-refresh "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".add-on"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"add-on.json"},{"type":"text","value":" on file changes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"publishing-tips","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Publishing Tips"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Keep add-on source in git (not just compiled output)."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Re-run "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack add-on compile"},{"type":"text","value":" after each metadata/template change."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Publish "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".add-on"},{"type":"text","value":" contents to a stable URL."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prefer immutable/versioned URLs for production use."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"maintenance-checklist","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maintenance Checklist"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When you update a custom add-on:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Update templates or metadata in your source project."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Re-run "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack add-on compile"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Test with a clean scaffold ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack create ... --add-ons <url>"},{"type":"text","value":")."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Verify install/build/lint in the generated app."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Publish updated "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".add-on"},{"type":"text","value":" assets."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"troubleshooting","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Troubleshooting"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add-on not found"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Verify URL points directly to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"info.json"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Template not applied"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Ensure file is in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".add-on/assets"},{"type":"text","value":" and ends with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".ejs"},{"type":"text","value":" if templated."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option not taking effect"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Confirm option key matches "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"addOnOption['<id>']"},{"type":"text","value":" usage in template."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Integration code not injected"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Check "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"integrations[].type"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"jsName"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"path"},{"type":"text","value":" in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".add-on/info.json"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"quick-start","text":"Quick Start","level":2},{"id":"structure","text":"Structure","level":2},{"id":"info-json","text":"info.json","level":2},{"id":"hooks-integrations","text":"Hooks (Integrations)","level":2},{"id":"demo-routes","text":"Demo Routes","level":2},{"id":"add-on-options","text":"Add-on Options","level":2},{"id":"ejs-templates","text":"EJS Templates","level":2},{"id":"distribution","text":"Distribution","level":2},{"id":"local-iteration-loop","text":"Local Iteration Loop","level":3},{"id":"publishing-tips","text":"Publishing Tips","level":3},{"id":"maintenance-checklist","text":"Maintenance Checklist","level":2},{"id":"troubleshooting","text":"Troubleshooting","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nAdd-ons add files, dependencies, and code hooks to generated projects.\n\nUse this guide when you want to build and maintain your own add-on outside the built-in catalog.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create base project\ntanstack create my-addon-dev -y\n\n# 2. Add your code\n#    - src/integrations/my-feature/\n#    - src/routes/demo/my-feature.tsx\n#    - Update package.json\n\n# 3. Extract add-on\ntanstack add-on init\n\n# 4. Edit .add-on/info.json\n\n# 5. Compile\ntanstack add-on compile\n\n# Optional: continuously rebuild while authoring\ntanstack add-on dev\n\n# 6. Test locally\nnpx serve .add-on -l 9080\ntanstack create test --add-ons http://localhost:9080/info.json\n```\n\n## Structure\n\n```\n.add-on/\n├── info.json        # Metadata (required)\n├── package.json     # Dependencies (optional)\n└── assets/          # Files to copy\n    └── src/\n        ├── integrations/my-feature/\n        └── routes/demo/my-feature.tsx\n```\n\nGenerated source of truth files in your project root:\n\n- `.add-on/info.json` - add-on metadata and integration config\n- `.add-on/package.json` - dependency/script additions merged into generated apps\n- `.add-on/assets/**` - template files copied into target apps\n\n## info.json\n\nRequired fields:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"My Feature\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.1\",\n  \"description\": \"What it does\",\n  \"type\": \"add-on\",\n  \"phase\": \"add-on\",\n  \"category\": \"tooling\",\n  \"modes\": [\"file-router\"]\n}\n```\n\n| Field | Values |\n|-------|--------|\n| `version` | Semantic version for your add-on metadata (e.g. `0.0.1`) |\n| `type` | `add-on`, `toolchain`, `deployment`, `example` |\n| `phase` | `setup`, `add-on`, `example` |\n| `category` | `tanstack`, `auth`, `database`, `orm`, `deploy`, `tooling`, `monitoring`, `api`, `i18n`, `cms`, `other` |\n\nOptional fields:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependsOn\": [\"tanstack-query\"],\n  \"conflicts\": [\"other-feature\"],\n  \"envVars\": [{ \"name\": \"API_KEY\", \"description\": \"...\", \"required\": true }],\n  \"gitignorePatterns\": [\"*.cache\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Hooks (Integrations)\n\nInject code into generated projects:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"integrations\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"root-provider\",\n      \"jsName\": \"MyProvider\",\n      \"path\": \"src/integrations/my-feature/provider.tsx\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n| Type | Location | Use |\n|------|----------|-----|\n| `root-provider` | Wraps app in `__root.tsx` | Context providers |\n| `provider` | Same, but simpler | Basic providers |\n| `vite-plugin` | `vite.config.ts` | Vite plugins |\n| `devtools` | After app in `__root.tsx` | Devtools |\n| `header-user` | Header component | User menu, auth UI |\n| `layout` | Layout wrapper | Dashboard layouts |\n\n## Demo Routes\n\n```json\n{\n  \"routes\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"/demo/my-feature\",\n      \"name\": \"My Feature Demo\",\n      \"path\": \"src/routes/demo/my-feature.tsx\",\n      \"jsName\": \"MyFeatureDemo\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Add-on Options\n\nLet users configure the add-on:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"options\": {\n    \"database\": {\n      \"type\": \"select\",\n      \"label\": \"Database\",\n      \"options\": [\n        { \"value\": \"postgres\", \"label\": \"PostgreSQL\" },\n        { \"value\": \"sqlite\", \"label\": \"SQLite\" }\n      ],\n      \"default\": \"postgres\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nAccess in EJS templates:\n\n```ejs\n<% if (addOnOption['my-feature']?.database === 'postgres') { %>\n// PostgreSQL code\n<% } %>\n```\n\n## EJS Templates\n\nFiles ending in `.ejs` are processed. Available variables:\n\n| Variable | Type | Description |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n| `projectName` | string | Project name |\n| `typescript` | boolean | TS enabled |\n| `tailwind` | boolean | Tailwind enabled |\n| `addOnEnabled` | object | `{ [id]: boolean }` |\n| `addOnOption` | object | `{ [id]: options }` |\n\nFile patterns:\n\n| Pattern | Result |\n|---------|--------|\n| `file.ts` | Copied as-is |\n| `file.ts.ejs` | EJS processed |\n| `_dot_gitignore` | Becomes `.gitignore` |\n| `file.ts.append` | Appended to existing |\n\n## Distribution\n\nHost on GitHub, npm, or any URL:\n\n```bash\ntanstack create my-app --add-ons https://example.com/my-addon/info.json\n```\n\n### Local Iteration Loop\n\nFastest way to iterate on a custom add-on:\n\n```bash\n# in your add-on project\ntanstack add-on compile\nnpx serve .add-on -l 9080\n\n# in another terminal\ntanstack create test-app --add-ons http://localhost:9080/info.json\n```\n\nIf you are actively editing templates, run `tanstack add-on dev` to auto-refresh `.add-on` and `add-on.json` on file changes.\n\n### Publishing Tips\n\n- Keep add-on source in git (not just compiled output).\n- Re-run `tanstack add-on compile` after each metadata/template change.\n- Publish `.add-on` contents to a stable URL.\n- Prefer immutable/versioned URLs for production use.\n\n## Maintenance Checklist\n\nWhen you update a custom add-on:\n\n1. Update templates or metadata in your source project.\n2. Re-run `tanstack add-on compile`.\n3. Test with a clean scaffold (`tanstack create ... --add-ons <url>`).\n4. Verify install/build/lint in the generated app.\n5. Publish updated `.add-on` assets.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **Add-on not found**: Verify URL points directly to `info.json`.\n- **Template not applied**: Ensure file is in `.add-on/assets` and ends with `.ejs` if templated.\n- **Option not taking effect**: Confirm option key matches `addOnOption['<id>']` usage in template.\n- **Integration code not injected**: Check `integrations[].type`, `jsName`, and `path` in `.add-on/info.json`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: creating-add-ons\ntitle: Creating Add-ons\n---\n\nAdd-ons add files, dependencies, and code hooks to generated projects.\n\nUse this guide when you want to build and maintain your own add-on outside the built-in catalog.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create base project\ntanstack create my-addon-dev -y\n\n# 2. Add your code\n#    - src/integrations/my-feature/\n#    - src/routes/demo/my-feature.tsx\n#    - Update package.json\n\n# 3. Extract add-on\ntanstack add-on init\n\n# 4. Edit .add-on/info.json\n\n# 5. Compile\ntanstack add-on compile\n\n# Optional: continuously rebuild while authoring\ntanstack add-on dev\n\n# 6. Test locally\nnpx serve .add-on -l 9080\ntanstack create test --add-ons http://localhost:9080/info.json\n```\n\n## Structure\n\n```\n.add-on/\n├── info.json        # Metadata (required)\n├── package.json     # Dependencies (optional)\n└── assets/          # Files to copy\n    └── src/\n        ├── integrations/my-feature/\n        └── routes/demo/my-feature.tsx\n```\n\nGenerated source of truth files in your project root:\n\n- `.add-on/info.json` - add-on metadata and integration config\n- `.add-on/package.json` - dependency/script additions merged into generated apps\n- `.add-on/assets/**` - template files copied into target apps\n\n## info.json\n\nRequired fields:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"My Feature\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.1\",\n  \"description\": \"What it does\",\n  \"type\": \"add-on\",\n  \"phase\": \"add-on\",\n  \"category\": \"tooling\",\n  \"modes\": [\"file-router\"]\n}\n```\n\n| Field | Values |\n|-------|--------|\n| `version` | Semantic version for your add-on metadata (e.g. `0.0.1`) |\n| `type` | `add-on`, `toolchain`, `deployment`, `example` |\n| `phase` | `setup`, `add-on`, `example` |\n| `category` | `tanstack`, `auth`, `database`, `orm`, `deploy`, `tooling`, `monitoring`, `api`, `i18n`, `cms`, `other` |\n\nOptional fields:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependsOn\": [\"tanstack-query\"],\n  \"conflicts\": [\"other-feature\"],\n  \"envVars\": [{ \"name\": \"API_KEY\", \"description\": \"...\", \"required\": true }],\n  \"gitignorePatterns\": [\"*.cache\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Hooks (Integrations)\n\nInject code into generated projects:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"integrations\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"root-provider\",\n      \"jsName\": \"MyProvider\",\n      \"path\": \"src/integrations/my-feature/provider.tsx\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n| Type | Location | Use |\n|------|----------|-----|\n| `root-provider` | Wraps app in `__root.tsx` | Context providers |\n| `provider` | Same, but simpler | Basic providers |\n| `vite-plugin` | `vite.config.ts` | Vite plugins |\n| `devtools` | After app in `__root.tsx` | Devtools |\n| `header-user` | Header component | User menu, auth UI |\n| `layout` | Layout wrapper | Dashboard layouts |\n\n## Demo Routes\n\n```json\n{\n  \"routes\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"/demo/my-feature\",\n      \"name\": \"My Feature Demo\",\n      \"path\": \"src/routes/demo/my-feature.tsx\",\n      \"jsName\": \"MyFeatureDemo\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Add-on Options\n\nLet users configure the add-on:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"options\": {\n    \"database\": {\n      \"type\": \"select\",\n      \"label\": \"Database\",\n      \"options\": [\n        { \"value\": \"postgres\", \"label\": \"PostgreSQL\" },\n        { \"value\": \"sqlite\", \"label\": \"SQLite\" }\n      ],\n      \"default\": \"postgres\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nAccess in EJS templates:\n\n```ejs\n<% if (addOnOption['my-feature']?.database === 'postgres') { %>\n// PostgreSQL code\n<% } %>\n```\n\n## EJS Templates\n\nFiles ending in `.ejs` are processed. Available variables:\n\n| Variable | Type | Description |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n| `projectName` | string | Project name |\n| `typescript` | boolean | TS enabled |\n| `tailwind` | boolean | Tailwind enabled |\n| `addOnEnabled` | object | `{ [id]: boolean }` |\n| `addOnOption` | object | `{ [id]: options }` |\n\nFile patterns:\n\n| Pattern | Result |\n|---------|--------|\n| `file.ts` | Copied as-is |\n| `file.ts.ejs` | EJS processed |\n| `_dot_gitignore` | Becomes `.gitignore` |\n| `file.ts.append` | Appended to existing |\n\n## Distribution\n\nHost on GitHub, npm, or any URL:\n\n```bash\ntanstack create my-app --add-ons https://example.com/my-addon/info.json\n```\n\n### Local Iteration Loop\n\nFastest way to iterate on a custom add-on:\n\n```bash\n# in your add-on project\ntanstack add-on compile\nnpx serve .add-on -l 9080\n\n# in another terminal\ntanstack create test-app --add-ons http://localhost:9080/info.json\n```\n\nIf you are actively editing templates, run `tanstack add-on dev` to auto-refresh `.add-on` and `add-on.json` on file changes.\n\n### Publishing Tips\n\n- Keep add-on source in git (not just compiled output).\n- Re-run `tanstack add-on compile` after each metadata/template change.\n- Publish `.add-on` contents to a stable URL.\n- Prefer immutable/versioned URLs for production use.\n\n## Maintenance Checklist\n\nWhen you update a custom add-on:\n\n1. Update templates or metadata in your source project.\n2. Re-run `tanstack add-on compile`.\n3. Test with a clean scaffold (`tanstack create ... --add-ons <url>`).\n4. Verify install/build/lint in the generated app.\n5. Publish updated `.add-on` assets.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **Add-on not found**: Verify URL points directly to `info.json`.\n- **Template not applied**: Ensure file is in `.add-on/assets` and ends with `.ejs` if templated.\n- **Option not taking effect**: Confirm option key matches `addOnOption['<id>']` usage in template.\n- **Integration code not injected**: Check `integrations[].type`, `jsName`, and `path` in `.add-on/info.json`.\n"}
